{
  "id": "tmc2240",
  "name": "TMC2240",
  "manufacturer": "Analog Devices (Trinamic)",
  "description": "The TMC2240 is a smart high-performance stepper motor driver IC with two fully integrated H-bridges rated at 3.0A full-scale current (5.0A absolute bridge peak limited by over-current protection) and a built-in 256-microstep indexer. It offers both SPI and single-wire UART serial communication, non-dissipative lossless current sensing, stealthChop2, spreadCycle, coolStep, combined stallGuard2 and stallGuard4 sensorless load detection, and on-chip temperature measurement. Found on modern high-end boards such as the LDO Leviathan and Mellow Fly-SHT36 Pro.",
